  "solution": {
    "text": "The coverging lens used for magnification is called simple microscope or a magnifier.<br /><br />When image is formed at <math><mi>D</mi></math>, the least distance of distinct vision, then magnifying power<br /><br /><math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Given, <math><mi>D</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>= 25 cm, <math><mi>f</mi></math> = 10 cm<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3.5</mn></math>",
